sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as LLMBatchGateway<br/>Reconciler
    participant Helm as Helm Chart<br/>Renderer
    participant SecretSync as Secret<br/>Synchronizer
    participant MetricsCtrl as Metrics<br/>Controller
    participant CertManager as cert-manager
    participant OSAPIServer as OpenShift<br/>APIServer
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(via ServiceMonitor)

    Note over Reconciler,OSAPIServer: Startup: TLS Profile Initialization
    Reconciler->>OSAPIServer: GET /apis/config.openshift.io/v1/apiservers<br/>Fetch TLS profile
    OSAPIServer-->>Reconciler: TLS Profile (cipher suites, min version)<br/>Fallback: Intermediate defaults

    Note over User,Helm: CR-to-Workload Reconciliation
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply LLMBatchGateway CR<br/>(batch.llm-d.ai/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event: LLMBatchGateway created/updated

    Reconciler->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart<br/>(CR spec + TLS profile values)
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests (Deployments, Services, etc.)
    Reconciler->>Helm: Render async-processor chart<br/>(CR spec + TLS profile values)
    Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Apply Deployments<br/>(apiserver, processor, gc, async)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Apply Services, ServiceAccounts, ConfigMaps
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Apply HTTPRoutes (Gateway API)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Apply Certificates (cert-manager)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Apply ReferenceGrants

    Note over SecretSync,K8sAPI: Secret Synchronization
    K8sAPI-->>SecretSync: Watch event: Secret changed
    SecretSync->>K8sAPI: Sync Secret to workload namespace<br/>(cross-namespace via ReferenceGrant)

    Note over MetricsCtrl,Prometheus: Monitoring Setup
    MetricsCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create metrics Service<br/>(:8443/HTTPS, serving-cert annotation)
    CertManager-->>MetricsCtrl: TLS certificate provisioned
    MetricsCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor + PrometheusRule
    Prometheus->>MetricsCtrl: GET :8443/metrics<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview

    Note over Reconciler,OSAPIServer: TLS Profile Change Detection
    OSAPIServer-->>Reconciler: TLS profile changed
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: SecurityProfileWatcher triggers<br/>graceful shutdown & restart

    Note over Reconciler,K8sAPI: Drift Reconciliation (every 5 min)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event: owned resource modified
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Re-apply desired state
